{#
    The release this instance runs, in muted text at the foot of the rail and
    of the narrow screen's sheet: "Renovo 1.7.0", or "Renovo 1.7.0 (a1b2c3d)"
    for an image built from a commit.

    Only the number is set in the figures font: the catalogued string is
    split around its placeholder so "Renovo" stays in the text font and the
    number sits inside `.num`, whatever order a language puts them in.

    Signed-in pages only, and the shell is drawn on no other: an anonymous
    visitor is not told which release to look up known issues for. An
    instance administrator's links to the Instance status card, where the
    update check's state is; for everybody else it is text.
#}
{% if current_user %}
    {% set parts = t('shell.version', {'version': "\x01"})|split("\x01") %}
    {% set label %}{{ parts[0] }}<span class="num">{{ app_version() }}</span>{{ parts[1]|default('') }}{% endset %}
    {% if current_user.isInstanceAdmin %}
        <a class="sidebar-version" href="/settings/instance#instance-status">{{ label }}</a>
    {% else %}
        <p class="sidebar-version">{{ label }}</p>
    {% endif %}
{% endif %}
